# WFORMTR.KEY - the password form of TEST/WFORMT.C, its password wiped
# once a save has sent it: a save refused on the password, the dialog
# staying with the password control empty, then cancelled; a save taken
# whose memo then fails, the dialog staying, then cancelled; a save
# refused as a server that finds no record the password names
# (RQ_ENOTFOUND on PASS), which is the field's refusal, the dialog
# staying, then cancelled.  Each time the frame's title says the slot
# holds none of the typed password, nor the original the save left;
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTR.SNP.
K F1
T Sesame42
K ENTER
S REFUSED
K ESC
S CHECKED1
K F1
T Sesame42
K CTRL-TAB
T x
K ENTER
S MEMOFAIL
K ENTER
S STAYED
K ESC Y
S CHECKED2
K CTRL-F1
T Sesame42
K ENTER
S NOTFOUND
K ESC
S CHECKED3
K ESC
